      "side": 1,
      "message": "Responding to comment from crrev/3587509: \"Oddly, the spec doesn\u0027t seem to contemplate this process failing, but I think we should be bailing out if we fail to transmit, similar to most of our other message sending states. (We don\u0027t seem to do this in Give_Battery_Status either. Maybe I\u0027m missing something.)\"\n\nDone. I have conditioned hard reset on a pd timer expiration or a protocol error like I see the other *_run functions in this file do.",
